# 5. Sprint Retrospective – Zomato Restaurant Search

**Sprint Feature:** Restaurant Search

### What Went Well

**1. Good teamwork:**
Developers and testers worked together during the sprint, which helped identify search-related bugs early.

**2. Search functionality was completed on time:**
The basic restaurant search and filtering features were completed within the planned sprint.

### What Could Be Improved

**1. Test data preparation:**
The team spent extra time creating different restaurant and location data for testing.

**2. Late requirement clarification:**
Some search-filter requirements were clarified late in the sprint, which caused some rework.

### Action Item for Next Sprint

**Prepare test data and clarify search/filter requirements before development starts.**

**Final Conclusion:**
The retrospective showed that the team worked well together, but better preparation and earlier clarification of requirements could make the next sprint smoother and faster.
